NOTE TO THE MAINTAINER: replace this file with the full legalcode before or shortly
after first publication. GitHub's license detector matches on the legalcode body,
not on a notice, so until it is pasted in this repository will show no license
badge and reusers will see a summary rather than terms. Fetch it with:

    curl -sL https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode.txt > LICENSE

then re-add the three lines above (title, SPDX identifier, copyright) at the top.
